{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"It takes the Half-elf a couple of tries until he finally manages to get a fire going, he stands and moves over to look at an old oil painting on the wall. \"Oh, sorry, my mum didn't raise me with much in the way of table manners, and my father? Proud British gentleman on the outside, but he was a right bastard at home, not much in the use of manners there...\" Loath says with a small smile and a shake of his head.","created_at":"2021-07-22T23:15:45.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867907802785513492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
