{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Oh, well that's absolutely true. My father died in the war actually...\" Loath says with a distant look. \"The War... What do you think of the war? Doxin of the Ironmane Clan?\" The Half-elf asks turning towards you.","created_at":"2021-07-22T23:19:43.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867908804582178826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
